dcc-proxy (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Match Clash Party unified delay, test URL selection, timeout and concurrency.
  * Use provider-specific health checks and preserve incremental node updates.
  * Start the first imported subscription when no active profile exists.
  * Reject occupied mixed ports before replacing a working core.
  * Allow initial geodata downloads to finish during configuration validation.

